          "question": "A chemical process separation unit operating under Distillation Column Internals and Hydraulic Sizing conditions is evaluated. Formulate the steady-state species conservation balance and interphase flux relations. Define the control volume boundary, evaluate driving force concentrations or partial pressures, and calculate unknown stream compositions and mass transfer rates. Formulate the analytical model, substitute representative process data in consistent SI units, and perform equipment verification.",
